{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41443","headline":"宿友人山居寄司徒相公 一 · 李建勳","name":"宿友人山居寄司徒相公 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨雪正霏霏，令人不忆归。\n地炉僧坐暖，山枿火声肥。\n隔纸烘茶蘂，移铛剥芋衣。\n知君在霄汉，此兴得还稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}